**Every one of the 176,223 rows a C1/C2/C3 training run would consume was built by the fallback path, two of the sixteen state slots are exactly constant so the design matrix has rank 14 and an infinite condition number, and the C1 and C2 targets in those rows are bounded `tanh` surrogates of a single gain ratio rather than the declared difference surplus and persistence forecast — and twelve of the thirteen defects found here would have been entirely silent in a training run.**

`DIAGNOSTIC_NOT_CLAIM`. Read-only measurement on a copy. No sealed constant,
threshold, sign, seed, horizon, price, guard, acceptance rule, declared control
law, search grid or optimizer setting was changed. No learner was run and no loss
value is offered as evidence about EE.

